<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>White Shark Cafe</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Lovejoy</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">One Simple Trick</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1Isyu0NKj3Scbad8myY79c</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.267" end="00:20.643">I saw you sitting, waiting for the moment to leave</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.643" end="00:24.525">Holding it together for the time in between</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.525" end="00:28.693">You haven't found your purpose yet, it's starting to seem</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.693" end="00:32.563">There's nothing left to find and only shit left to see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.563" end="00:36.686">And I know why</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.686" end="00:44.686">Big</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.225" end="00:49.614">'Cause I've been reading 'bout the things that I hate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.614" end="00:53.766">Heeding the expiry, privately love the taste</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.766" end="00:57.889">Hate to see a murder, but I can't look away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.889" end="01:01.627">Rubberneck the shooter just to mock their mistakes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.627" end="01:07.261">And I feel fine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.261" end="01:09.207">Lately</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.207" end="01:11.125">I've been bored</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.125" end="01:15.243">I need something I've never felt before</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.243" end="01:17.209">And take me back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.209" end="01:19.377">To when I was young</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.377" end="01:27.377">I need something I've never felt before</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.027" end="01:34.915">I've been chasing flower lately</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.915" end="01:39.296">It's been a couple weeks since Mary last said she missed me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.296" end="01:43.352">Try to make her smile without exposing her teeth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.352" end="01:47.555">Clamouring to Heaven, baby, please, God forgive me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.555" end="01:51.670">One day you will see what I mean</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.670" end="01:55.615">Aiming down the barrel of a lit remedy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.615" end="01:59.911">We act like AB positive, it's sickening me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.911" end="02:03.655">Never need to give, and universally received</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.655" end="02:09.274">And I know why</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.274" end="02:11.125">Lately</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.125" end="02:13.191">Well, I've been bored</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.191" end="02:17.338">I need something I've never felt before</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.338" end="02:19.389">And take me back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.389" end="02:21.424">When I was young</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.424" end="02:25.635">I need something I've never felt before</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.635" end="02:27.774">Waiting</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.774" end="02:29.803">On your call</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.803" end="02:33.886">Say something I've never heard before</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.886" end="02:35.987">And what you gave</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.987" end="02:37.987">He wanted more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.987" end="02:45.987">I need something I've never felt before</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.797" end="02:52.959">I stay awake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.959" end="02:57.089">Miss every single day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.089" end="03:01.303">They're all the same, they're all the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.303" end="03:05.418">They're all the same, they're all the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.418" end="03:09.509">I stay awake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.509" end="03:13.711">Miss every single day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.711" end="03:17.868">Oh, they're all the same, they're all the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.868" end="03:25.868">They're all the same, they're all the same, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:30.753" end="03:35.107">And you're not scared of what you don't know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:35.107" end="03:39.217">Everything's a circus or a shit puppet show</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:39.217" end="03:42.902">I could spend a weekend watching shock videos</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:42.902" end="03:44.402">On my laptop</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:44.206" end="03:49.449">And it would feel better than the thought of</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:49.449" end="03:53.449">You</p></div></body></tt>